# Where the API lives. Leave it unset and the client asks the origin it was
# served from — right in production, and right in dev too, because
# vite.config.ts proxies /admin and /auth to a local API.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.supermovies.example

# Where `npm run dev` proxies /admin and /auth. Only used in dev.
# API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:8010
